Bug reports, ideas and security reports are welcome. Pull requests with code are not accepted. By sending feedback you give the author a free, worldwide, perpetual and irrevocable right to use it, including in the Software.

9. Responsible use

You may use the Software only on websites and systems that you own or are authorised to test. You alone are responsible for the lawfulness of your use (compare for example section 202c of the German Criminal Code and the law of your country). The built-in limits and protections only prevent accidental misuse. Their circumvention is a modification and is prohibited.

